{"n":109,"name":"Al-Kafirun","meaning":"The Disbelievers","ayahs":6,"startPage":603,"verses":[{"i":1,"ar":"قُلۡ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلۡكَٰفِرُونَ","tr":"Qul ya ayyuha alkafiroona","en":"Say, \"O disbelievers"},{"i":2,"ar":"لَآ أَعۡبُدُ مَا تَعۡبُدُونَ","tr":"La aAAbudu ma taAAbudoona","en":"I do not worship what you worship"},{"i":3,"ar":"وَلَآ أَنتُمۡ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعۡبُدُ","tr":"Wala antum AAabidoona ma aAAbudu","en":"Nor are you worshippers of what I worship"},{"i":4,"ar":"وَلَآ أَنَا۠ عَابِدٞ مَّا عَبَدتُّمۡ","tr":"Wala ana AAabidun ma AAabadtum","en":"Nor will I be a worshipper of what you worship"},{"i":5,"ar":"وَلَآ أَنتُمۡ عَٰبِدُونَ مَآ أَعۡبُدُ","tr":"Wala antum AAabidoona ma aAAbudu","en":"Nor will you be worshippers of what I worship"},{"i":6,"ar":"لَكُمۡ دِينُكُمۡ وَلِيَ دِينِ","tr":"Lakum deenukum waliya deeni","en":"For you is your religion, and for me is my religion"}]}